# Glider Staff's airbend is "up to one target creature" (CR 115.1d): Bot1 chooses no target (the Bot1 Target() line), so
# nothing is exiled and both Memnites and Bot2's Ornithopter stay. Equip {2} onto the first Memnite and then, on turn 5, onto the
# second: the bonus (+1/+1 and flying) leaves the first Memnite and the second has it (CR 301.5c).

